	SAY NAME2 "Ravager +6"
	SAY DESC "The Ravager is a weapon of singular, terrifying purpose. Its name is not merely a title, but a literal description of its effect on the battlefield. Forged in the depths of the Abyss by master smiths whose names are now forgotten, this halberd was designed to be the ultimate harvester of souls. The blade is forged from a dense, light-absorbing obsidian alloy, etched with pulsating crimson runes that glow with a malevolent light whenever blood is drawn.
	
	Combined with the Serpent Shaft, this dark halberd has become one of the deadliest weapons in the Realms.

STATISTICS:

Combat abilities:
